// 'Awaken' (enemy_1531_bbrain): Journey shots, Blink with Shattered Vision, a
// revive that releases the wave and fills inactive R-Series Power Armors, and
// a second form with +25% ATK, four-way Journey and the high-ground stun. Her
// damage sharing stays with the reviewed talent:DamageSplit (enemy-awaken-features.js).
// Every component reachable from the retained abilities, the templates and the
// four projectiles are pinned below with local references reduced to null/local.
